---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="w-full py-12 mt-auto border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-500 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-400 to-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">サーバー送信なしの無料ツール集</span>
      </div>
      <div>&copy; {currentYear} GlowPunch運営事務局. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 justify-center font-medium">
      <a href="/#tools" class="hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">ツール一覧</a>
      <a href="/guide" class="hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">使い方</a>
      <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">ブログ</a>
      <a href="/about" class="hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">運営者情報</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">お問い合わせ</a>
      <a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">プライバシーポリシー</a>
      <a href="/disclaimer" class="hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">免責事項</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
